{"availability":"available","full":"neurobloomai/market-tools","name":"market-tools","description":"Free, open-source market dashboards and quality stock screeners for US and India markets","category":"Finance","language":"HTML","stars":15,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-26T14:30:18Z","updated":"2026-10-07T00:54:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://neurobloomai.github.io/market-tools/","topics":["fundamental-analysis","india-stocks","iv-rank","market-breadth","momentum","moving-average","options-trading","python","quality-investing","stock-market","stock-screener","technical-analysis","trading-tools","yfinance"],"demo":"https://neurobloomai.github.io/market-tools/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.427Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.427Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.427Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.427Z","stars":15,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Free, open-source market dashboards and quality stock screeners powered by Yahoo Finance.","Quality gate — the screener filters aren't just revenue growth or price momentum. Debt/EV + operating margin + net margin + ROE + FCF together mean only businesses that can survive a bad year get through. That's the survivability filter. Quality doesn't raise win rate — it makes losses survivable and wins compoundable.","Structure confirmation — 4/4 MA alignment means the market agrees with the fundamentals. Price, momentum, and quality all pointing the same direction before anything is acted on. No thesis without structure. No structure without thesis."],"features":["AUM compounders (BLK, BX, ARES, FHI, AAMI): management fees on a growing AUM base. Capital-light — the business doesn't need a large equity base to generate fee income, so ROE runs structurally high and that is…","Spread-dependent (JPM, BAC, WFC): borrow short, lend long — net interest margin is the engine. ROE is leverage-amplified (10–15x balance sheet). Fragile to rate inversions, credit cycle turns, and regulatory capital…","Performance/volatility-dependent (VIRT): revenue correlated to market volatility, not compounding. High-vol years are windfall years; low-vol years compress spreads. Passes quality gates when conditions are right — but…","Swing (days to weeks): structure and momentum are everything. Enter when the coil is tight and CMF confirms. Exit when the structure breaks. No thesis attachment — the trade is the trade.","Position (weeks to months): quality starts to matter more than timing. A name with A+ fundamentals and 4/4 structure can absorb noise. You're riding the trend, not the tick."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neurobloomai/market-tools/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a82756d57ececdbe82052897c068553bedeeca850f73dca58935734faf8c6ba2","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.588Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.588Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Free, open-source market dashboards and quality stock screeners powered by Yahoo Finance.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neurobloomai/market-tools/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a82756d57ececdbe82052897c068553bedeeca850f73dca58935734faf8c6ba2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neurobloomai/market-tools/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.590Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T00:54:55Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/neurobloomai/market-tools/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:39.593Z","hash":"a82756d57ececdbe82052897c068553bedeeca850f73dca58935734faf8c6ba2","originalBytes":124547,"storedBytes":124547,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["quality","india","weekly","price","universe","what","extension","market","names","same","signal","watchlist","when","daily","ceiling","name","gate","structure","one","high","above","only","python3","framework","runway","spread","aligned","bo